{"labs": [{"id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le01ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hello Peter!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>:  Hey. What are you doing here so early in the morning? Uh-oh! What's with the huge bag?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm having a little household problem! My washing machine is busted and I have heaps of laundry to do.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Ugh! Poor you! You can do a few loads here, no problem. What happened to your machine?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It seems to be leaking and rattling and last night it just stopped working altogether.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Shoot! I was thinking I might help you fix it, but it sounds like it needs replacing.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le01ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ouch! That's going to be expensive! I guess if it needs to be done, it needs to be done.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Well, maybe it needs to be looked at first. There's no sense in getting a new one if it can be fixed.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: These household appliances can be so badly designed. I mean, I only bought it brand new a couple of years ago.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Geez! That's too bad. The warranty has probably expired by now. Was it a recognized brand?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It was on sale and not the top of the line, but it wasn't the cheapest one. I can't remember the brand. It isn't one I know well.", "id": 2, "time": "34000", "image": "engenn9le01ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: I hate to say it, but that's your mistake right there. It's always worth spending the money if you can.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, you know I like to be careful with my money.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Yes. I do. You are a bit parsimonious at times! Still, I know how you feel, my fridge needs  fixing. I certainly don't want to have to buy a new one!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, my clothes need to be washed, so can I put a load in?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>:  Yup ... and I'll put some coffee on!", "id": 3, "time": "73000", "image": "engenn9le01ob01re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le01ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about household problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can react to things going wrong and how to solve problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things that need to be done.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Have you ever had a problem in your home? Explain.", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you do if something needs to be fixed? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "What do you do when things go wrong?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"t