"type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Needs to Be Done and Needs Doing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Need + passive infinitive and need + verb + ing are two structures you use to talk about fixing problems. You use these structures to imply that you don't know who will fix the problem, or that the person fixing the problem is not the focus of the sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Subject + Need + Passive Infinitive", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">It needs to be looked at first.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The subject of the sentence is the thing that needs fixing/to be fixed.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + Need + Verb + ing", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">The washing machine needs replacing.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If it needs to be done, it needs to be done.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My fridge needs fixing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My clothes need to be washed. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Reacting to Things Going Wrong", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "We use Paralanguage to react to a situation.<br/><br/>These are sounds you use to show an emotional reaction.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expression\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Ugh!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" A negative reaction of disappointment or frustration.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Shoot!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" An expression you use when you make a mistake or something goes wrong.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Ouch!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" A reaction to something that hurts.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Geez!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" A reaction of disbelief or understanding. Can be used as a negative or positive reaction.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Uh-oh!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" A negative reaction to misfortune or a mistake.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Uh-oh! What's with the huge bag?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Ugh! Poor you! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Shoot! I was thinking I might help you fix it but it sounds like it needs replacing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Ouch! That's going to be so expensive! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Geez! That's too bad.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to leak", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to let a liquid or gas enter or escape through a hole", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It seems to be leaking.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when a washing machine is broken.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "busted", "type": "name"}, {"content": "damaged or destroyed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My washing machine is busted.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to rattle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make a rapid series of short sharp sounds", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  It seems to be leaking and rattling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "heap ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a great or large quantity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have heaps of laundry to do.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "load", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an amount of something that something can contain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can do a few loads of laundry here, no problem.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "warranty ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an promise by a manufacturer, promising to repair or replace an item within a specific period of time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The warranty has probably expired by now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to expire ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to come to an end", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The warranty has probably expired by now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "parsimonious ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "really stingy ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You are a bit parsimonious at times! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ouch", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used to express pain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Ouch! That's going to be so expensive! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Identify three or four things that need to be repaired at home or at school.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain the order in which things need to be repaired.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Research online the names of the tools you would use to repair them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a list of the things that need repairing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your list and the names of the tool that you researched.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about what needs to be repaired.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain what needs to be repaired first.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I research the names of some tools that might be used to repair the problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write the names of the tools down.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a list of the things that need to be repaired.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my list of tools to a friend.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}